    "my_take": {
      "value": "Pi is one of my favorite harnesses. I used it extensively before building Neuman and partially to build Neuman. What I love about Pi is its simplicity. A lot of these harnesses become a mass of code produced by swarms of agents running 24/7, and they become completely incomprehensible and often very buggy. Pi took a very different approach in being a very minimal harness that you can customize. I think it's a great project and it serves as a invaluable source of information for guiding Neuman's harness.",
